{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1543383-mage-20th-books","id":1543383,"title":"Mage 20th Books","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-08T20:00:19-07:00","id":1543383,"title":"Mage 20th Books","content":"I got my Lore of the Traditions book, and I pulled my collection together and got them all on the shelf. I noticed there are some gaps in the numbers, and wondered what I am missing.<br /> <br /> I have:<br /> I: Mage 20th Anniversary Edition<br /> II: Book of Secrets<br /> IV: Gods and Monsters<br /> VI: Book of the Fallen<br /> VII: Technocracy Reloaded<br /> X: Rich Bastard\u2019s Guide to Magic<br /> XII: Operative\u2019s Dossier<br /> XIII: Sorcerer<br /> XIV: Lore of the Traditions<br /> <br /> I believe that:<br /> III: Art of Mage<br /> V: Mage Cookbook<br /> <br /> But what are VII, IX, and XI? I assume one is Victorian Age?<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28594-deinol","name":"Deinol","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-09T01:47:40-07:00","id":1543403,"title":"","content":"You're also missing <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/162241/m20-how-do-you-do-that\" target=\"_blank\"><i>How Do You Do That?</i></a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://f